ob filename text video be input ya

exists su name heading text ob text "Solon's Reform Saved Athens" be default ya
exists su name frame file ob filename "/workplace/examples/out/thumbnail-last-frame.png" be default ya
exists su name output file ob filename "/workplace/examples/out/thumbnail-last-frame-burn.png" be default ya

ob text "mkdir -p /workplace/examples/out" be command do

ob text of ob of video to name text video path be text do

ob text "ffmpeg -y -sseof -1 -i \"" to name text extract cmd be text do
ob name text video path to name extract cmd be plus do
ob text "\" -frames:v 1 \"" to name extract cmd be plus do
ob text of ob of frame file to name extract cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name extract cmd be plus do
ob name extract cmd be command do

su name burn stage from filename of ob of frame file with name text heading text to filename of ob of output file be thumbnail heading burn do

su name result out ob text of ob of output file be write do
